SUMMARY:Seasonal Jam Making Workshop
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\n\n	\n		\n			\n			Experience the joy of making seasonal jams! 
 Learn to create delicious homemade preserves with fresh fruits and spices. 
 Enjoy hands-on activities\, and expert tips\, and leave with your jars of 
 flavorful jams. It's a delightful blend of fun and flavor for 
 everyone\n			\n		\n	\n
