SUMMARY:Canva Creation: Beginner to Pro NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nCanva has rapidly become the #1 website to create designs for 
 millions of people around the world. This course is designed for absolute 
 beginners to become masters of Canva\, for personal or work use. Learn how 
 to design social media posts\, flyers\, presentations\, and more from 
 scratch in this course!\n\nWe will supply laptops and students are required 
 to use them. A personal subscription to Canva Pro is optional but highly 
 encouraged for this course. Students must know their Canva account login 
 information ahead of time. \n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Conference Room
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Computers & Technology
UID:LibCal-10306-16539206
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16539206
