SUMMARY:NJ Dates Speed Dating Event: Singles 30-39 at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:When’s the last time you actually did something on a Saturday afternoon instead of just thinking about it? Let’s change that. Join NJ Dates for a speed dating event where meeting people happens the old-fashioned way: in person\, over a beer.\nNo rushing from work. No scrambling for childcare. Just a relaxed 3-5pm window on a Saturday afternoon to meet quality singles in your age range. Grab a beer\, settle in\, and let the connections happen naturally. \nHere’s How It Works (It’s So Easy!): \nEnjoy a series of 9-12 fun\, timed conversations with other singles \nUse your matchboard to select who you’d like to see again \nMutual matches hit your inbox 1 hour after the event ends \nNJ Dates maintains a balanced ratios so everyone gets a great experience \nFirst round is on us! Your ticket includes a full pour \nNo pressure\, no awkwardness. Just real conversations with people who are actually looking to connect. Plus\, you’re done in time for dinner plans (maybe even with someone you just met). \nReady to give it a shot? Grab your ticket and we’ll see you here! \nGrab a beer\, jump into the mix\, and turn a regular night out into something way better. \n✨ vibe • meet • match \nThis is a Hetero Event. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/nj-dates-speed-dating-event-singles-30-39-at-montclair-brewery/
LOCATION:Montclair Brewery\, 101 Walnut Street\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community,Entertainment,Kids & Families
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Misc.-Social-Posts-7.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Brewery":MAILTO:Staff@montclairbrewery.com
END:VEVENT
