SUMMARY:The Unfulfilled Promises of the U.S. Pivot to Asia NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nDespite America's 2009 pledge to prioritize its ties with the 
 Indo-Pacific\, successive administrations\, distracted by crises elsewhere 
 in the world\, never delivered. As a result\, the regional leaders are 
 turning to China.
