SUMMARY:MILL Mindfulness in the Garden
DESCRIPTION:These classes are a Partner Program with the Montclair Institute for Lifelong Learning. To register please visit: http://schedulesplus.com/montclair/kiosk \nThursdays\, 1:30 PM – 2:30 PM \nJune 25th – Mindfulness in the Garden – Jodi Brooks will guide us through very gentle stretching & breathwork\, and an outdoor contemplative garden walk. This is a practice of slowing down\, cultivating quiet and paying attention to our senses. All levels are welcome. No experience needed. Cold or rainy weather – class will be held indoors\, with a short walk outdoors (weather permitting). (Outdoor Program\, indoors if inclement weather)
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/mill-mindfulness-in-the-garden/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
