BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Montclairlocal": "https://montclairlocal.news/event/nutley-summer-festival/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:montclairlocal
X-SOURCE:Montclair Local News
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260625T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260625T220000
DTSTAMP:20260624T001643
CREATED:20260622T193714Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260622T193714Z
UID:10140418-1782410400-1782424800@montclairlocal.news
SUMMARY:Nutley Summer Festival
DESCRIPTION:Commissioner Mauro G. Tucci and Commissioner Alphonse Petracco\, proudly present the Annual Summer Festival on Thursday\, June 25\, 2026. From 6:00 PM to 10:00 PM\, **Franklin Avenue\, between Chestnut Street and New Street\, ** will be transformed into the vibrant setting for Nutley’s most anticipated event of the season: Summer Fest. \nNutley prides itself on its strong sense of community involvement\, and SUMMER FEST is the highlight event of the season. Bring your family\, friends\, and neighbors and experience the spirit and unity that make Nutley an extraordinary place to live. Whether you come to reconnect with old friends or enjoy the great music\, food\, and activities\, don’t miss this one-of-a-kind event! “Summer Fest is more than just an event\, it’s a celebration of who we are as a community\,” stated Commissioner Tucci. “It’s a chance for residents of all ages to come together\, enjoy great entertainment\, and create lasting memories right here in the heart of Nutley.” \nThis year’s festival features live music by The Guys\, A Broadway Jersey Boys Experience. Bringing the timeless sound of Frankie Valli and The Four Seasons to life\, The Guys deliver an electrifying Broadway-style tribute that captures the energy\, harmony\, and excitement of the iconic Jersey Boys phenomenon. The Guys create an unforgettable concert experience that celebrates the music\, memories\, and magic of a generation. \nA mouthwatering variety of food trucks will be on site\, including: \n\n\n\n\n\nEmilio’s Wood Fire Pizza\nMozzarella God\nAngry Archie’s\nEmpanada Guy\nMi Sabor Boricua\nPita Bowl\nEl Gallo de Oro\n\n\n\n\nRude Dawgs\nJust Delicious Kettlecorn\nCarnival Concessions\nSummerfresh Lemonade\nIce Cream Creations\nSweet Life Café\nVaritage Brew Works\n\n*Vendors subject to change\n\n\n\nThere will be plenty of entertainment for kids and families\, including: \n\n\n\n\n\nA gaming truck\nBounce houses\n\n\n\n\nFace painters\nBalloon animals\n\n\n\n\n\nThe event is free and open to the public\, and all are welcome to attend. Don’t miss this opportunity to kick off summer with music\, food\, fun\, and community spirit with our second concert of the 2026 Summer Concert Series. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/nutley-summer-festival/
LOCATION:Franklin Avenue\, Nutley\, Between Chestnut and New Streets\, Nutley
CATEGORIES:Community,Entertainment,Kids & Families
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/summerfest2026.png
END:VEVENT
