BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Montclairlocal": "https://montclairlocal.news/event/you-are-not-your-trauma/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:montclairlocal
X-SOURCE:Montclair Local News
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260625T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260625T210000
DTSTAMP:20260624T001643
CREATED:20260618T150803Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260618T150803Z
UID:10140404-1782414000-1782421200@montclairlocal.news
SUMMARY:You Are Not Your Trauma
DESCRIPTION:YOU ARE NOT YOUR TRAUMA: A panel conversation on identity\, healing\, and reclaiming self within LGBTQ+ experiences \nJoin us for an intentional and affirming conversation centered on trauma\, identity\, and healing within the LGBTQ+ community. \nThis panel brings together lived experience\, professional insight\, and community-based perspectives to explore what it means to move beyond survival and begin reclaiming your voice\, boundaries\, and sense of self. \nTogether\, we’ll create space for honest dialogue\, connection\, and reflection. \nDate: Thursday June 25\, 2026\, 7-9pm \nLocation: Union Congregational Church\n176 Cooper Ave\, Montclair\, NJ in the Guild Room in the Main Building \nRegister at: https://www.tickettailor.com/events/outmontclair/2257009 \nPanelists: \nNancy Robles\, DM\nCEO/President for Eastern Funding LLC\nPublished Author \nJennie Vila\, EdM\, LPC\nClinical supervisor and founder of Growth Mindset\, LLC \nLucas Manrique\, LAC\, NCC\nEngaging and compassionate educator\, clinician and advocate\, dedicated to advancing BIPOC\, immigrant\, and LGBTQIA+ rights. \nKristin Wald\, DVRT certified advocate\nVice President of the Board for Start Out Fresh Intervention Advocates (S.O.F.I.A.) \nJaz Parker\, DVRT certified advocate\nBoard Member for Start Out Fresh Intervention Advocates (S.O.F.I.A.) \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/you-are-not-your-trauma/
LOCATION:Union Congregational Church\, 176 Cooper Ave\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07043\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/723110971_18098100845588917_5399042584894639733_n.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Out Montclair":MAILTO:info@outmontclair.org
END:VEVENT
