SUMMARY:Poetry Happy Hour
DESCRIPTION:Explore the poetry stacks with a small group\, find something 
 worth reading aloud\, and talk about it over light refreshments. John 
 Wodnick\, recently retired English teacher and lifelong poetry reader\, 
 keeps the conversation going. All levels welcome. Space is limited\, 
 register to save your spot.\n\nDisclaimer: This program is volunteer-led 
 and facilitated. The program facilitator is a community volunteer and does 
 not represent Montclair Public Library or speak on its behalf. All 
 attendees are expected to engage respectfully and in accordance with MPL's 
 code of conduct at all times. The Library reserves the right to remove any 
 participant who does not adhere to these standards.
