SUMMARY:Nature Explorers - June
DESCRIPTION:Nature Explorers \nJune 27\, July 18\, August 1 & 15\, 10:30AM – 12:30PM \nIntroducing our new family program\, Nature Explorers. This is a free program offered on select Saturdays. Each session will be host to a different garden or nature inspired activity such as\, planting in our Kitchen Garden\, creating and adding to a community art project\, seasonal scavenger hunts\, bird watching\, and much more! Summer sessions are weather permitting as activities will be held fully outdoors.  \nFee: Free\, pre-registration is encouraged.  \n \n  \n  \n 
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/nature-explorers-june/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes,Children,Family
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairfoundation.org/content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_0433-2-rotated.jpg
END:VEVENT
