SUMMARY:V for Volleyball June27th 1-7pm Watchung BBQ
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nI'm Mike 
 and my son is Michael. Join us as we play for fun initially\, then we'll k
 eep score. When we make teams\, we'll get a bit competitive where you must
  serve to score! Games will be to 25. No kicking\, no using your head.\n\n
 We'll have 2 Mikasa balls & 1 Wilson ball.\nWe have our own Volleyball NET
 \, poles\, & ropes!\nThere's a fire pit so we cook & have a barbecue.\nPle
 ase bring some snacks\, food\, or drinks or ice to share if you can.\nIf y
 ou have fun and would like to play with us at other locations\, join us!\n
 [V for Volleyball New Jersey | Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/groups/1
 587314685975434)\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/w8ZFJhe6s4GBLF24A
