SUMMARY:Independence Day Flower Arrangement Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the spirit of freedom with a journey into the timeless art of Japanese flower arranging. Ikebana is a discipline that goes beyond simply placing flowers in a container—it is a meditative practice that emphasizes nature\, balance\, and minimalism. \nIn this special Independence Day workshop\, we explore the connection between bold expression and tranquil tradition. By focusing on line\, form\, and color\, you will learn to interpret the vibrant energy of liberty through simple\, intentional design. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
