X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_lets_walkprogram
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_314477911@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260624T041648Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T110000
SUMMARY:🥾 Let's Hike!! Jockey Hollow 
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nLet's celebrate the nation's semiquincentennial 
 (can you pronounce that?)\n\nCome hike with us in the Morristown National 
 Historic Park. We'll do about 3 miles along the Grand Parade loop\, see a 
 colonial era house and garden\, and Revolutionary War soldier hut (replica
 s). It's a little like traveling back in time 250 years\n\n[AllTrails: Gra
 nd Parade Loop](https://www.alltrails.com/trail/us/new-jersey/grand-parade
 -trail?u=i&sh=vgtzxk)\n\n**PLEASE NOTE THIS WALK IS AT 09:30**\n**Please a
 rrive 5 minutes early so we can start on time.**\n\nWe've scouted these tr
 ails and find them appropriate for most of our members. If you've walked w
 ith us at Eagle Rock\, this is similar in difficulty with just a little mo
 re up and down. There may be wet or muddy sections and a few rocks and tre
 e roots. Please wear hiking boots/shoes and bring trekking poles or a walk
 ing stick\, if you prefer.\n\nDon't forget your water!\n\nInclement weathe
 r may cancel this event. Please check the event page for comments prior to
  leaving for the meetup.\n\n**Disclaimer:** If you join this event\, pleas
 e understand that you are responsible for your own preparedness and well-b
 eing and will hold no one else liable in case of injury or mishap.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/314477911/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260425T182648Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260425T182648Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Themindfulstream": "https://www.meetup.com/themindfulstream/events/315223293/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_themindfulstream
X-SOURCE:Meetup: The Mindful Stream
UID:event_315223293@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260624T041649Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260703T111500
SUMMARY:Simple Sitting Meditation
DESCRIPTION:The Mindful Stream\nIn these sessions\, I will be doing guided
  meditations where we simply sit and notice what arises.\n\nThere is no ag
 enda and no plan for how these sessions unfold. I might start off simply b
 y asking us to notice what is already present. By becoming aware of what
 ’s going on in our heads and in our body.\n\nThen\, the meditation may t
 ake on a life of its own.\n\nOur job is to simply be present to what arise
 s. We may notice the mind moving and chattering about. Or we may notice th
 at it’s completely silent.\n\nThe goal here\, if there is one\, is to si
 mply let ourselves be as we are.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/themindfulstream/events/315223293/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260612T021140Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260612T021140Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
