DTEND:20260707T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260707T000000Z
SUMMARY:Introduction to Wheel Throwing Pottery NEW
DESCRIPTION:Note: This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nDiscover the art of working on the potter’s wheel in this 
 hands-on 6-week introductory course. Whether you're a complete beginner or 
 looking to refine basic skills\, this class offers a welcoming environment 
 to explore the fundamentals of working with clay on the wheel.\n\nYou’ll 
 learn the essential techniques of centering\, pulling\, shaping\, and 
 trimming clay to create functional forms like bowls and cups. As the course 
 progresses\, you’ll be introduced to glazing methods and the firing 
 process\, transforming your pieces into finished\, food-safe ceramics. By 
 the end of the session\, you’ll have several unique\, handmade pieces to 
 take home and enjoy.\n\nAll clay\, glaze\, firings and tools are 
 included.\n\nFor the first class\, bring an apron or work clothes\, 
