SUMMARY:Garden To Table - July
DESCRIPTION:Garden to Table \nSummer Sessions: Wednesday Mornings\, 10:30am – 11:30am  \nJuly 8 – Tea & Mini Garden Sandwiches \nAugust 19 – Lemonade & Watermelon Salad \nEnjoy quality time in the garden with your child/children as we explore the Kitchen Garden and all that it has to offer. Help us weed and water\, plant\, and harvest. We will prepare a simple snack with ingredients inspired by the garden. Appropriate for children ages 4 and up but all are welcome. Children must be accompanied by an adult.  \n \nFee: $15/class per child for Members / $20/class per child for General Public \nRegistration required – Registration Deadline is 1 day prior to each class \n \nSponsored by Montclair State University 
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/garden-to-table-july/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes,Children
