SUMMARY:Creating with Nature: Rock Painting
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, July 8\, 6:30 PM – 7:30 PM \nFind your calm one brushstroke at a time.  Using natural stones as tiny canvases\, we’ll explore simple painting techniques and the joy of painting without any pressure for perfection.  Come relax and turn ordinary rocks into meaningful little works of art while taking time to reflect and reconnect with ourselves.  No artistic experience needed – just an open mind and desire to play. \nFee: Individual Class: $12 Members / $17 General Public \nPre Registration is required.  There are no drop-ins for this class. \n \nRock image credit: AnnRos
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/creating-with-nature-rock-painting/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes,Adults
