SUMMARY:Sweet and Savory Arab Cuisine for the Summer - Cooking Demo and Tasting NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nJoin FARAH (Foundation for Arab American Heritage) for a fun 
 culinary night! Learn to make Layali Loubnan (a dessert with a 
 dairy-semolina base topped with whipped cream and chopped pistachio and 
 flavored with lemon and orange blossom)\,and Moujadara (a dish 
 incorporating black lentils\, bulgur wheat and pine nuts\, garnished with 
 cilantro). Sample them both at the end of the class. Two dishes\, two 
 delights!
