UID:10007617-1784368800-1784372400@montclairfoundation.org
SUMMARY:Creating with Nature: Color Walk
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, July 18\, 10:00 -11:00 AM \nTake a walk\, follow a color and see what unfolds. Join us on a Color Walk for a playful way to reconnect with yourself and the world around you.  We’ll slow down\, notice the colors and beauty within nature\, and use guided prompts to welcome personal reflection and sparking creativity.  It’s part mindful walk and part creative practice while tuning into nature.  No pressure for perfection or writing/art experience needed. \nFee: \nIndividual Class: $12 Members / $17 General Public \nPre Registration is required.  There are no drop-ins for this class.
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/creating-with-nature-color-walk/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes,Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairfoundation.org/content/uploads/2026/05/Rhododendron-calandulaceum-flame-azalea.jpg
END:VEVENT
