UID:10007563-1784626200-1784629800@montclairfoundation.org
SUMMARY:Mindfulness in the Garden
DESCRIPTION:Mindfulness in the Garden  \nTuesdays\, July 7\, 14\, 21 & 28\, 9:30 AM – 10:30 AM \nInstructor: Jodi Brooks \nDiscover how a mindfulness practice can help us awaken and  live in harmony with oneself and with the natural world. This class will include: simple instructions for getting started with a formal mindfulness practice\, very gentle stretching & breathwork\, and an outdoor contemplative garden walk. This is a practice of slowing down\, cultivating quiet and paying attention to our senses. All levels are welcome. No experience needed. Class will be held outdoors. Class may be cancelled due to weather if no indoor space is available. \nFee:   \nSeries Rate (includes 4 classes): $60 Members / $80 General Public \nIndividual Class: $15 Members / $20 General Public \nPre Registration is required.  There are no drop-ins for this class.
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/mindfulness-in-the-garden/2026-07-21/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes,Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairfoundation.org/content/uploads/2026/06/Mindfulness-2.jpg
END:VEVENT
