 ork\, each session is programmed to build real strength and leave you ene
 rgized for the rest of the day. Instructors scale every movement so you w
 ork at the right intensity for your level.\nHow do I Sign-up?\n\nRegistra
 tion is not required.\nFREE for students with a valid Montclair State ID\
 n\nWhere and When?\n\nTuesdays\, July 6 - July 30\n12:00 pm - 12:30 pm\nS
 tudent Recreation Center - Multipurpose Room 1\n\nInstructor: Jeffrey\n\n
 \n\n\n\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditional Information can be f
