SUMMARY:The Art of Leaf and Flower Pressing - Make Your Own Press 
DESCRIPTION:Partner Program with the Adult School of Montclair \nWednesday\, July 22\, 1:00-2:30 PM \nPreserve beautiful garden memories that can last for years by making a simple flower press during this class. Get started by filling it with samples from the Van Vleck Garden. (indoors – with a short walk to collect materials to press). Take home a bookmark to fill with botanicals in a few weeks when they’re ready. \nRegistration opens on June 11th at The Adult School of Montclair Website at:  www.adultschool.org.
