X-SOURCE-ID:montclairfoundation_calendar_of_events
X-SOURCE:Montclair Foundation
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260723T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260723T160000
DTSTAMP:20260624T001652
CREATED:20260512T163607Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260601T171441Z
UID:10007540-1784806200-1784822400@montclairfoundation.org
SUMMARY:The Secret Tea Room at Van Vleck - SOLD OUT!
DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, July 23 – Cream Tea \nFriday\, July 24 – Cream Tea \nSaturday\, July 25 – Afternoon Tea \nSeating times: \n11:30 AM – 1:00 PM\n12:00 PM -1:30 PM\n1:00 PM – 2:30 PM\n2:30 PM – 4:00 PM\n\n\nJoin us for an enchanting Cream Tea or Afternoon Tea in the House Living Room at Van Vleck House & Gardens! \nUpon arrival\, you will be offered a menu of fine teas and infusions. Your choice of tea will be brewed to perfection. Once everyone is settled in\, the tiers will arrive with freshly baked scones\, jam\, homemade clotted cream\, scrumptious sandwiches\, and a dessert. We hope you will join us! \nThis event is for adults and children ages 13+. Seatings are 90 minutes\, and registration is required. \nDietary Restrictions\nA gluten-free option is available with prior notice. We are not able to accommodate a dairy-free or vegan diet. All requests must be communicated to us 48 hours before the event. You may note this request on the checkout page. \nPlease note that this event is a fundraiser\, and a portion of your ticket price will go towards supporting our beloved Van Vleck House & Gardens. \nCream Tea: Member Price: $45\, General Price: $55 \nAfternoon Tea: $60 Members | $70 General Public. This tea includes more desserts. \nA 10% gratuity for your server is included in tea pricing. \n\n\n \nNEW!  A VERY SPECIAL OFFERING BEGINNING IN OCTOBER \nThe Secret Tea at Van Vleck House & Gardens\nA Private Tea Experience \n\nExperience Afternoon Tea in the elegant historic dining room of Van Vleck House & Gardens with an exclusive private seating for up to 12 guests during one of our regularly scheduled Secret Tea Room services. \nThis three-hour experience offers a unique opportunity to enjoy tea in a beautiful and private setting while supporting The Montclair Foundation and Van Vleck House & Gardens. \nGuests will enjoy The Secret Tea Room’s signature tea service featuring delicious seasonal offerings in one of Montclair’s most charming historic homes. \nExclusive Dining Room Seating\n\n12 guests\nThree-hour private experience during scheduled tea service dates\nWeekday seating: $175 per person\nSaturday seating: $200 per person\n\nAvailability is limited and offered only in conjunction with existing tea service dates. For more information email richard@secrettearoom.us.
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/the-secret-tea-room-at-van-vleck-12-2/
