DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260730T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260730T133000
SUMMARY:Smarter Queries Start Here: Vector Search in SQL Server & Azure SQ
 L DB
DESCRIPTION:Cloud Data Driven\nMicrosoft SQL databases now support vector 
 search and embeddings\, enabling semantic queries that go beyond keywords.
 \n\nThis session shows how to store\, index\, and query embeddings using f
 amiliar T-SQL.\n\nYou’ll learn how to power smarter search\, recommendat
 ions\, and natural language interfaces—all within your database. Real-wo
 rld examples will highlight practical use cases.\n\nIf you're ready to lev
 el up your queries\, this is where it starts.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/cloud-data-driven/events/315354321/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260621T142535Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260621T142535Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
