BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Neearth": "https://neearth.org/events/fall-harvest-fiesta/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:neearth
X-SOURCE:Northeast Earth Coalition
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T210000
DTSTAMP:20260602T154315Z
CREATED:20260505T163944Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260602T154315Z
UID:3403-1790447400-1790456400@neearth.org
SUMMARY:Fall Harvest Fiesta
DESCRIPTION:Join NEEC for a festive evening celebrating another year\nof community\, sustainability\, and bountiful harvests.\n  \nDine on a delicious Mexican buffet\, catered by Mezoco. Enjoy live music. Bid on wonderful silent auction items. \nAll proceeds go toward NEEC projects — our six community gardens\, 18 Free Little Pantries\, and three pollinator gardens. With your help\, we can continue to feed the food insecure and advocate for a more sustainable community. \nFor tickets\, visit NEECfiesta2026.eventbrite.com. \nWe are excited to invite community organizations\, businesses\, and individuals to become sponsors. For more information about sponsorship opportunities\, email Amanda at amccabe@neearth.org.
URL:https://neearth.org/events/fall-harvest-fiesta/
LOCATION:Glen Ridge Congregational Church\, 195 Ridgewood Ave\, Glen Ridge\, NJ\, 07028\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community Outreach
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://neearth.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/fiesta-invitation2.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Lets Walkprogram": "https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/sqdsftyjcnbdb/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_lets_walkprogram
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_sqdsftyjcnbdb@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260624T041648Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261002T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261002T101500
SUMMARY:Eagle Rock Reservation
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nJOIN US FOR A WALK. WE WALK AT A MODERATE PACE O
 N UNPAVED PATHS.\n\nWe will hike for about an hour - 3.5 miles. We will be
  walking on trails in the woods\, so appropriate footwear\, long pants & s
 ocks\, and bug spray.\n\nWill will meet at:\n[https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXC
 ntdE1neD7](https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXCntdE1neD7) Eagle Rock Trail Parking
  Lot by Kiosk#1\n\nIf you enter from Eagle Rock Way\, go pass the Highlawn
  and stay left. There will be a parking lot at the end of the curve to you
 r right.\n\nEagle Rock Reservation is 408 acres of hills\, streams\, and v
 alleys located on the borders of West Orange\, Verona\, and Montclair\, Ne
 w Jersey. Though located in the middle of the most densely populated count
 y in the most densely populated state in the country\, the Reservation is 
 mostly undeveloped and boasts an extensive trail system within its borders
 .\n\n**Please make sure to RSVP and arrive 5 minutes prior to start time.*
 *\n\nFOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM - letswalkmeetup\n\nDisclaimer: If you join us
  for a hike\, please understand that you are responsible for your own prep
 aredness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in case of injury
  or mishap. Event will be canceled in the event of extreme weather.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/sqdsftyjcnbdb
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20230629T233908Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20230629T233908Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
